tekne-apt-sources (0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Brave and XLibre repositories with scoped keys and pins.
    Brave's sources use Brave's own file name and key path, so brave-keyring
    doesn't link its key into /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d.

